  "reason": "Existing RNA-only evidence shows multiprofile scvi_n200 is much stronger than single-profile or PCA transformer, but PCA multiprofile has only been tested with transformer aggregation, leaving uncertainty about whether PCA is inherently weak or whether avgpool aggregation would help. config_002 tests PCA multiprofile with avgpool, directly comparable to config_005 for encoder effects and config_003 for aggregation effects. This is the best next use of budget because it is a low-cost, single-factor comparison that clarifies the RNA representation and aggregation design space before adding image or fusion complexity."
}

